#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10002
#: 3af9682554734c558c98dbe441420fe1
msgid "Analyze Long-Term Trends and Detect State Changes"
msgstr "長期トレンドを解析して状態変化を見つける"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10004
#: a1cbc601d31f48b5b193725d8365cf41
msgid ""
"Continuous monitoring of gravitational-wave detector subsystems involves "
"processing slow-cadence sensor records (e.g., temperatures, seismometers, "
"vacuum gauges) over spans of 24 to 48 hours. The goal is to distinguish slow "
"diurnal drifts from short-duration transient pulses and persistent step-like "
"state changes, while properly handling data gaps."
msgstr "重力波検出器サブシステムの継続的監視では、24〜48時間にわたる低速サンプリングのセンサ記録（温度計、地震計、真空計など）を処理します。目的は、データ欠損を適切に処理しながら、ゆっくりとした日周ドリフト、短時間の過渡パルス、および持続的なステップ状状態変化を正確に識別することです。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10006
#: 3c7cf16acf394bbd973852695a0eedbe
msgid "**What you will achieve:**"
msgstr "**このチュートリアルで達成できること：**"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10007
#: 3d7aa504011c4818a13c6bdde298ab41
msgid ""
"Generate a 48-hour 4-channel slow sensor dataset with diurnal drift, "
"transient pulses, state changes, and data gaps."
msgstr "日周ドリフト、過渡パルス、状態変化、データ欠損を含む48時間・4チャンネルの低速センサデータセットを生成します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10008
#: f194e7cd5e4b4dae82ae8664420822da
msgid ""
"Estimate a low-pass baseline using contiguous valid segments without bridging"
" across missing data."
msgstr "欠損データをまたいで補間することなく、連続する有効セグメントのみを用いて低域通過基線を推定します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10009
#: bc89e16234b3483da8242e405663fd83
msgid ""
"Detect positive transient pulses on the residual stream and step-like "
"transitions on sample-to-sample differences."
msgstr "残差系列上の正の過渡パルスと、標本間差分に基づくステップ状の遷移を検出します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10010
#: 8969c983356f4388b95b70fbb0946133
msgid "Verify gap policies and export structured event catalogs with unit sidecars."
msgstr "ギャップ処理ポリシーを検証し、単位情報を付加した構造化イベントカタログを出力します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10011
#: 0ab6e3f5885242068ddc49c6fb12b2c1
msgid "Display inline figures and verify all required metrics."
msgstr "インライン図面を表示し、すべての必須メトリクスを検証します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/monitoring/long_term_trend.ipynb:10013
#: b7d5b3fea0284881b3725e6d6717c50c
msgid "**Data type**: Synthetic sensor voltage records (48 hours at dt=60 s)."
msgstr "**データ種別**: 合成センサ電圧記録（48時間、サンプリング周期 dt=60秒）。"

